expenditure share \eqn{s_{it} = \pi_{it}x_{it} / \sum_j \pi_{jt}x_{jt}}{s_it = pi_it x_it / sum_j pi_jt x_jt}.
With \eqn{\bar{s}_{it} = (s_{it} + s_{i,t-1})/2}{sbar_it = (s_it + s_i,t-1) / 2}, the methods are
